    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Moscas"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Fernando Eimbcke’s fifth feature, a gentle black-and-white comedy set in a gloriously retro-feel Mexico City, sees an unlikely friendship emerge between a cantankerous landlady and her unexpected tenant."
    },
