    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Olga is not having the best of times. To obtain some extra cash, she decides to rent a room to Tulio, one of the relatives of a cancer patient at the nearby hospital, unaware of the fact that that he is also sneaking his young son into the accommodation. Eimbcke’s wonderful film is a witty companion piece to Duck Season, his engaging feature debut."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Maria Delgado"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With thanks to Embassy of Mexico in the United Kingdom."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "How to book"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Tickets start from £10 for all screenings and events in London, with concessions available for many screenings. Booking information and ticket prices .",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Booking information and ticket prices",
          "url": "https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=tickets-booking-information"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For non-Members we charge £1 per ticket for online and phone bookings, up to £3 per transaction. There’s no booking fee if you buy tickets at the box office."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "If you’re aged 16 to 25, sign up for free to BFI 25 and Under for a chance to get £6 tickets (without booking fees) to all screenings and events, subject to availability.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "BFI 25 and Under",
          "url": "https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=25-and-under-lff"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Missed out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "More tickets may become available for these screenings before and during the festival. Find out about extra ticket releases and standby queues .",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Find out about extra ticket releases and standby queues",
          "url": "https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=tickets-booking-information#extra-ticket-releases"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Our programmers recommend..."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/perra-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "La Perra"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Acclaimed Chilean director Dominga Sotomayor delivers a beautifully shot character-driven study of dependency, loneliness and the complex relationship between past and present."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/meltdown-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "The Meltdown"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sutherland Award winner Manuela Martelli delivers a knife-edge thriller centring on the disappearance of a teenager in a remote Chilean resort."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/isabel-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Isabel"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Gabe Klinger’s film, shot on 16mm, is a gentle, warm and beautifully observed love letter to the pleasures of wine."
    }
